# The bar: two drinks, a recruit hired, a recruit rejected.
Return Escape Return @snap:hub
Down Down Down Down @snap:bar_sel  # hub row 4 BAR
Return   @snap:bar
Return   @snap:drink_1           # row 0 ORDER_DRINK
Return   @snap:drink_1_after
Return   @snap:drink_2
Return   @snap:drink_2_after
Down     @snap:recruit_sel       # row 1 RECRUIT_INTERVIEW
Return   @snap:recruit
Return   @snap:hire              # row 0 HIRE_RECRUIT
Return   @snap:recruit_2
Down     @snap:reject_sel        # row 1 REJECT_RECRUIT
Return   @snap:reject
Down     @snap:bar_done_sel      # row 2 PLANET_HUB
Return   @snap:hub_back
